EXPORTS
    ListGetDetectString
    ListSetDefaultParams
    ListLoad
    ListLoadW
    ListLoadNext
    ListLoadNextW
    ListCloseWindow
    ListSearchText
    ListSearchTextW
    ListSendCommand
    ListPrint
    ListPrintW
    ListGetPreviewBitmap
    ListGetPreviewBitmapW
